abstract: >-
  Independent reproducibility materials for HP-GSBS neural-state segmentation:
  six figure sources, controlled benchmark observations and tables, four BBBD
  EEG analysis matrices and saved FP64 outputs, and a complete Sherlock fMRI
  group/16-participant application with boundary-alignment statistics, source
  provenance and public rerun scripts. Original code is MIT; source datasets
  and applicable derived materials retain CC BY 4.0 attribution.
keywords:
  - GSBS
  - neural state segmentation
  - neuroinformatics
  - reproducibility
  - EEG
  - fMRI
